{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  MAIN PRODUCT — página de produto  ← PRIORIDADE MÁXIMA
  ============================================================

  HIERARQUIA DA COLUNA DE INFORMAÇÕES (o que importa para comprar, em ordem):
    1. Versão + nome + clube/temporada            → block "title"
    2. Preço, Pix e parcelas                       → block "price"
    3. Tamanho + guia de tamanhos (modal)          → block "size"
    4. Aviso de personalização (pedido pelo WhatsApp)  → block "personalization"
    5. Adicionar ao carrinho (principal) +
       Comprar agora (secundário) + formas de
       pagamento                                   → block "buy_buttons"
    6. Prazo por CEP (separado, com título)        → block "shipping"
    7. Garantias                                   → block "guarantees"
    8. Detalhes em acordeão                        → blocks "accordion"
  Depois da section: Recomendações (por tags) e FAQ (inclui caimento).

  GALERIA:
  - Celular: carrossel deslizável com contador.
  - Desktop: miniaturas centralizadas à esquerda + foto principal com
    setas. Sem posição fixa.
  - Clique em qualquer foto abre a galeria em tela cheia (<dialog>
    .lightbox) com fade, setas, arrastar para os lados, Esc e clique
    fora para fechar.

  DADOS: tamanho é variante; opções com um valor só (ex.: "Customization
  type") ficam escondidas e marcadas. Metafields titular.* opcionais.
  Personalização = line item properties (Número, Nome, _personalizada).

  JS: assets/produto.js. "Comprar agora": assets/carrinho.js.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign product_form_id = 'product-form-' | append: section.id
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign mf = product.metafields.titular
  assign versao = mf.versao.value
  assign active_media_id = current_variant.featured_media.id | default: product.featured_media.id
  assign media_count = product.media.size

-%}

<section class="product page-width" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}" data-product-section>
  {%- comment -%} ========== GALERIA ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="product__gallery{% if media_count > 1 %} product__gallery--thumbs{% endif %}" aria-label="{{ 'products.product.media.gallery_viewer' | t }}">
    {%- if media_count > 1 -%}
      <ul class="product__thumbs" role="list">
        {%- for media in product.media -%}
          <li>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="product__thumb media"
              style="--ratio: 3 / 4;"
              data-thumb="{{ media.id }}"
              aria-label="{{ 'products.product.media.load_image' | t: index: forloop.index }}"
              {% if media.id == active_media_id %}aria-current="true"{% endif %}
            >
              {{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}
            </button>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="product__stage">
      <ul class="product__media-list" role="list" data-gallery>
        {%- for media in product.media -%}
          <li class="product__media-item media{% if media.id == active_media_id %} is-active{% endif %}" style="--ratio: 3 / 4;" data-media-id="{{ media.id }}" data-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
            {%- if media.media_type == 'image' -%}
              <button type="button" class="product__zoom" data-lightbox-open="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="{{ 'titular.product.open_gallery' | t: index: forloop.index }}">
                {%- liquid
                  assign loading = 'lazy'
                  if forloop.first
                    assign loading = 'eager'
                  endif
                -%}
                {{
                  media
                  | image_url: width: 1440
                  | image_tag:
                    loading: loading,
                    sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 45vw, 100vw',
                    widths: '390, 600, 780, 1080, 1440',
                    alt: media.alt | default: product.title | escape
                }}
              </button>
            {%- elsif media.media_type == 'video' -%}
              {{ media | video_tag: controls: true, image_size: '1080x' }}
            {%- elsif media.media_type == 'external_video' -%}
              {{ media | external_video_tag }}
            {%- else -%}
              {{ media | media_tag }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- else -%}
          <li class="product__media-item media is-active" style="--ratio: 3 / 4;">{{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>

      {%- if media_count > 1 -%}
        <button type="button" class="product__arrow product__arrow--prev icon-button" data-gallery-prev aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.previous_slide' | t }}">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</button>
        <button type="button" class="product__arrow product__arrow--next icon-button" data-gallery-next aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.next_slide' | t }}">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</button>
        <p class="product__media-counter text-label" aria-hidden="true" data-gallery-counter>1 / {{ media_count }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ========== INFORMAÇÕES ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="product__info">
    {%- form 'product',
      product,
      id: product_form_id,
      class: 'product__form',
      novalidate: 'novalidate',
      data-type: 'add-to-cart-form'
    -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ current_variant.id }}" class="product-variant-id">

      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- case block.type -%}
          {%- when '@app' -%}
            <div class="product__block">{% render block %}</div>

          {%- when 'title' -%}
            <div class="product__block product__title" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if versao != blank -%}
                <span class="tag text-label">{{ versao | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <h1 class="text-h2">{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>
              {%- capture meta_line -%}
                {%- if mf.clube != blank -%}{{ mf.clube.value | escape }}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if mf.temporada != blank %} · {{ mf.temporada.value | escape }}{% endif -%}
                {%- if mf.modelagem != blank %} · {{ mf.modelagem.value | escape }}{% endif -%}
              {%- endcapture -%}
              {%- if meta_line != blank -%}
                <p class="text-small muted">{{ meta_line }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

          {%- when 'price' -%}
            <div class="product__block product__price" {{ block.shopify_attributes }} data-product-price>
              {% render 'price', product: current_variant, use_variant: false, show_compare: true %}
              {% render 'price-extras', amount: current_variant.price %}
            </div>

          {%- when 'size' -%}
            {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
              <div class="product__block product__options" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
                  {%- assign opt_index = forloop.index0 -%}
                  {%- comment -%} Opção com um valor só: escondida e já marcada. {%- endcomment -%}
                  {%- if option.values.size == 1 -%}
                    <fieldset class="product__option" data-option-index="{{ opt_index }}" hidden>
                      <input type="radio" name="option-{{ opt_index }}" value="{{ option.values.first | escape }}" checked>
                    </fieldset>
                    {%- continue -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <fieldset class="product__option" data-option-index="{{ opt_index }}">
                    <div class="product__option-head">
                      <legend class="text-label">{% render 'option-label', name: option.name %}</legend>
                      {%- if opt_index == 0 and settings.page_size_guide != blank -%}
                        <button type="button" class="button--link text-small product__guide" aria-haspopup="dialog" data-dialog-open="SizeGuide-{{ section.id }}">
                          {% render 'icon', name: 'ruler' %}{{ 'titular.product.size_guide' | t }}
                        </button>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>
                    <div class="size-picker">
                      {%- for value in option.values -%}
                        {%- liquid
                          assign value_available = false
                          for variant in product.variants
                            if variant.available and variant.options[opt_index] == value
                              assign value_available = true
                              break
                            endif
                          endfor
                          assign input_id = 'Option-' | append: section.id | append: '-' | append: opt_index | append: '-' | append: forloop.index0
                        -%}
                        <input
                          type="radio"
                          class="visually-hidden size-picker__input"
                          id="{{ input_id }}"
                          name="option-{{ opt_index }}"
                          value="{{ value | escape }}"
                          {% if option.selected_value == value %}checked{% endif %}
                        >
                        <label for="{{ input_id }}" class="size-picker__label {% unless value_available %}is-sold-out{% endunless %}">
                          <span class="text-label">{{ value }}</span>
                          {%- unless value_available -%}
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}</span>
                          {%- endunless -%}
                        </label>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </div>
                  </fieldset>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            {%- endunless -%}

          {%- comment -%}
            4. Personalização: só um aviso. Nome e número são pedidos pelo
            WhatsApp (não há cobrança automática do valor extra no checkout).
            "WhatsApp" é só destaque visual, sem link. Aparece se o produto
            tiver uma opção de personalização (ex.: "Customization type") ou o
            metafield titular.personalizavel.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- when 'personalization' -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign has_custom = false
              if mf.personalizavel.value == true
                assign has_custom = true
              endif
              for option in product.options
                assign option_down = option | downcase
                if option_down contains 'custom' or option_down contains 'personaliz'
                  assign has_custom = true
                endif
              endfor
            -%}
            {%- if has_custom -%}
              <p class="product__block product__custom-note notice text-small" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {% render 'icon', name: 'info' %}
                <span>{{ 'titular.personalization.request_html' | t }}</span>
              </p>
            {%- endif -%}

          {%- when 'buy_buttons' -%}
            <div class="product__block product__buy" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <div class="product__atc">
                <button
                  type="submit"
                  name="add"
                  class="button button--full button--large text-label product__add-to-cart"
                  {% unless current_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
                >
                  <span>
                    {%- if current_variant.available -%}
                      {{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}
                    {%- else -%}
                      {{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                </button>
              </div>
              <button
                type="submit"
                name="add"
                class="button button--secondary button--full text-label product__buy-now"
                data-buy-now
                {% unless current_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
              >
                {{- 'titular.product.buy_now' | t -}}
              </button>
              {% render 'payment-icons' %}
            </div>

          {%- when 'shipping' -%}
            <div
              class="product__block product__shipping"
              {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
              data-shipping-estimate
              data-handling-days="{{ mf.prazo_dias.value | default: 0 }}"
              data-regions='{{ block.settings.regions | escape }}'
              data-text-invalid="{{ 'titular.shipping.cep_invalid' | t | escape }}"
              data-text-result="{{ 'titular.shipping.cep_result' | t: min: '__MIN__', max: '__MAX__' | escape }}"
            >
              <div class="product__shipping-head">
                {% render 'icon', name: 'truck' %}
                <label class="text-label" for="Cep-{{ section.id }}">{{ 'titular.shipping.label' | t }}</label>
              </div>
              <div class="inline-form">
                <input class="field__input" id="Cep-{{ section.id }}" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="postal-code" placeholder="{{ 'titular.shipping.placeholder' | t }}" maxlength="9" data-cep-input>
                <button type="button" class="button button--secondary" data-cep-submit>{{ 'titular.shipping.submit' | t }}</button>
              </div>
              <p class="text-small" aria-live="polite" data-cep-result></p>
            </div>

          {%- when 'guarantees' -%}
            <ul class="product__block product__guarantees" role="list" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if block.settings.text_1 != blank -%}<li class="notice text-small">{% render 'icon', name: 'exchange' %}<span>{{ block.settings.text_1 | escape }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.text_2 != blank -%}<li class="notice text-small">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}<span>{{ block.settings.text_2 | escape }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.text_3 != blank -%}<li class="notice text-small">{% render 'icon', name: 'shield' %}<span>{{ block.settings.text_3 | escape }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}
            </ul>

          {%- when 'accordion' -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign accordion_content = blank
              case block.settings.source
                when 'description'
                  assign accordion_content = product.description
                when 'page'
                  assign accordion_content = block.settings.page.content
                  if accordion_content == blank
                    assign accordion_content = settings.page_versions.content
                  endif
                else
                  assign accordion_content = block.settings.text
              endcase
            -%}
            {%- if accordion_content != blank -%}
              <details class="accordion__item product__accordion" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <summary class="accordion__summary text-label">
                  {{ block.settings.heading | escape }}
                  {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}
                </summary>
                <div class="accordion__content rte text-body">{{ accordion_content }}</div>
              </details>
            {%- endif -%}

          {%- when 'custom_liquid' -%}
            <div class="product__block" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ block.settings.custom_liquid }}</div>
        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endform -%}
  </div>

  <script type="application/json" data-variant-json>
    [
      {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
        {%- capture variant_price_html -%}
          {% render 'price', product: variant, use_variant: false, show_compare: true %}
          {% render 'price-extras', amount: variant.price %}
        {%- endcapture -%}
        {
          "id": {{ variant.id | json }},
          "options": {{ variant.options | json }},
          "available": {{ variant.available | json }},
          "featured_media_id": {{ variant.featured_media.id | json }},
          "price_html": {{ variant_price_html | strip_newlines | json }}
        }{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ]
  </script>

  {%- comment -%} ========== GALERIA EM TELA CHEIA ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if product.media.size > 0 -%}
    <dialog class="lightbox" aria-label="{{ 'products.product.media.gallery_viewer' | t }}" data-lightbox>
      <div class="lightbox__track" data-lightbox-track>
        {%- for media in product.media -%}
          {%- if media.media_type == 'image' -%}
            <figure class="lightbox__slide" data-lightbox-slide>
              {{ media | image_url: width: 2000 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '780, 1200, 1600, 2000', sizes: '90vw', alt: media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}
            </figure>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="lightbox__close icon-button" data-dialog-close aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}">{% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}</button>
      <button type="button" class="lightbox__arrow lightbox__arrow--prev icon-button" data-lightbox-prev aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.previous_slide' | t }}">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</button>
      <button type="button" class="lightbox__arrow lightbox__arrow--next icon-button" data-lightbox-next aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.next_slide' | t }}">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron' %}</button>
      <p class="lightbox__counter text-label" aria-live="polite" data-lightbox-counter></p>
    </dialog>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>

{%- comment -%} Modal do guia de tamanhos: mesmo conteúdo da página de ajuda {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.page_size_guide != blank -%}
  <dialog id="SizeGuide-{{ section.id }}" class="modal" aria-labelledby="SizeGuide-{{ section.id }}-title">
    <div class="drawer__header">
      <h2 id="SizeGuide-{{ section.id }}-title" class="text-h3">{{ settings.page_size_guide.title | escape }}</h2>
      <button type="button" class="icon-button" data-dialog-close aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}">
        {% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="drawer__body rte text-body table-scroll">{{ settings.page_size_guide.content }}</div>
  </dialog>
{%- endif -%}

<script src="{{ 'produto.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .product { display: grid; gap: var(--space-6); padding-bottom: var(--space-12); }

  /* ---------- Galeria ---------- */
  .product__gallery { margin-inline: calc(var(--page-gutter) * -1); }
  .product__thumbs { display: none; }
  .product__stage { position: relative; }
  .product__media-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-auto-flow: column;
    grid-auto-columns: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .product__media-list::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .product__media-item { scroll-snap-align: start; }
  .product__zoom { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; cursor: zoom-in; }
  .product__zoom img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .product__arrow { display: none; }
  .product__media-counter {
    position: absolute;
    right: var(--page-gutter);
    bottom: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  /* ---------- Informações: ritmo vertical ---------- */
  .product__form > .product__block + .product__block { margin-top: var(--space-6); }
  .product__title > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .product__price { padding-bottom: var(--space-6); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .product__price .price-extras { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .product__price .price-extras > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-1); }

  .product__option { border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .product__option + .product__option { margin-top: var(--space-6); }
  .product__option-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-4); margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .product__guide { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); }
  .size-picker { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(calc(var(--tap) + var(--space-6)), 1fr)); gap: var(--space-2); }
  .size-picker__label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: calc(var(--tap) + var(--space-2));
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .size-picker__input:checked + .size-picker__label { color: var(--ink-inverse); background: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink); }
  .size-picker__input:focus-visible + .size-picker__label { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .size-picker__label.is-sold-out { color: var(--ink-disabled); border-style: dashed; text-decoration: line-through; }

  /* Aviso de personalização: "WhatsApp" sublinhado e em destaque, sem link. */
  .product__custom-note { padding: var(--space-4); background: var(--surface-alt); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }
  .whatsapp-mark {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Compra: botão principal maior, secundário logo abaixo. */
  .product__buy > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .button--large { min-height: calc(var(--tap) + var(--space-4)); }
  .product__atc {
    position: sticky;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 5;
    margin-inline: calc(var(--page-gutter) * -1);
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--page-gutter);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .product__buy .payment-icons { margin-top: var(--space-4); }

  /* Entrega: bloco próprio, separado do resto. */
  .product__form > .product__shipping { margin-top: var(--space-12); padding-top: var(--space-6); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .product__shipping > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .product__shipping-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); }

  .product__guarantees > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .product__form > .product__accordion { margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .product__form > :not(.product__accordion) + .product__accordion { margin-top: var(--space-6); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

  /* ---------- Galeria em tela cheia ---------- */
  .lightbox {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: none;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-inverse);
    background: var(--ink);
  }
  .lightbox[open] { animation: lightbox-fade 200ms ease-out; }
  .lightbox::backdrop { background: var(--ink); opacity: 1; }
  @keyframes lightbox-fade { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .lightbox[open] { animation: none; } }
  .lightbox__track {
    display: grid;
    grid-auto-flow: column;
    grid-auto-columns: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .lightbox__track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .lightbox__slide { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-4); scroll-snap-align: center; }
  .lightbox__slide img { max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; width: auto; height: auto; object-fit: contain; }
  .lightbox .icon-button { color: var(--ink-inverse); --focus: var(--ink-inverse); }
  .lightbox__close { position: absolute; top: var(--space-2); right: var(--space-2); }
  .lightbox__arrow { position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); }
  .lightbox__arrow--prev { left: var(--space-2); }
  .lightbox__arrow--next { right: var(--space-2); }
  .lightbox__arrow--prev svg { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .lightbox__arrow--next svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
  .lightbox__counter { position: absolute; bottom: var(--space-4); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }

  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .product { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr); gap: var(--space-12); padding-top: var(--space-6); align-items: start; }

    /* Desktop: miniaturas centralizadas na lateral + foto com setas. Sem posição fixa. */
    .product__gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-4); align-items: center; margin-inline: 0; }
    .product__gallery--thumbs { grid-template-columns: var(--space-24) minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .product__thumbs { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); }
    .product__thumb { width: 100%; padding: 0; border: 1px solid transparent; cursor: pointer; }
    .product__thumb[aria-current="true"] { border-color: var(--ink); }
    .product__media-list { display: block; overflow: visible; }
    .product__media-item { display: none; }
    .product__media-item.is-active { display: block; }
    .product__media-list:not(:has(.is-active)) > .product__media-item:first-child { display: block; }
    .product__arrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    }
    .product__arrow--prev { left: var(--space-4); }
    .product__arrow--next { right: var(--space-4); }
    .product__arrow--prev svg { transform: rotate(90deg); }
    .product__arrow--next svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
    .product__atc { position: static; margin-inline: 0; padding: 0; }
    .lightbox__slide { padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-24); }
    .lightbox__arrow--prev { left: var(--space-6); }
    .lightbox__arrow--next { right: var(--space-6); }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

